---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import SchemaMarkup from '../components/SchemaMarkup.astro';
import { webPageSchema, breadcrumbSchema } from '../utils/schema';

const schema = [
  webPageSchema('Terms and Conditions', 'eLan Technology terms and conditions - rules governing use of our website and services.', '/terms-conditions/'),
  breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Terms and Conditions', url: '/terms-conditions/' }]),
];
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions"
  description="eLan Technology terms and conditions - rules governing use of our website and services."
  lastUpdated="2026-09-24"
>
  <SchemaMarkup schema={schema} />

  <h2>Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms and Conditions govern your use of <a href="https://elan-tech.net">elan-tech.net</a>
    and provide the general conditions applicable to enquiries and services offered by eLan
    Technology. A quotation, accepted proposal, statement of work, invoice, product terms or signed
    agreement may add to or replace parts of these general terms. If there is a conflict, the later
    written agreement for that service prevails to the extent of the conflict.
  </p>

  <h2>Services</h2>
  <p>
    eLan Technology provides professional digital services including web design, web development,
    digital marketing, branding, accessibility-related implementation, mobile applications,
    integrations, configurable products and website maintenance. The included deliverables,
    dependencies, timetable, acceptance method, support and exclusions are defined in writing before
    commencement. Website descriptions are not a substitute for the accepted scope.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      All creative work, code, and deliverables produced by eLan Technology remain our intellectual
      property until full and final payment has been received.
    </li>
    <li>
      On satisfaction of the applicable payment and acceptance terms, the client receives only the
      ownership, licence, access and reuse rights expressly stated in the accepted proposal.
    </li>
    <li>
      Our proprietary frameworks, internal tools, reusable components, and development processes
      remain the exclusive property of eLan Technology and are not transferred to the client.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Payment Terms</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The deposit, milestones, taxes, currency, gateway charges and payment schedule are stated in the accepted proposal or invoice.</li>
    <li>
      Final files, production deployment, transferable licences, source-code access or credentials
      may be withheld until the corresponding payment and handover conditions are satisfied.
    </li>
    <li>Any late fee or interest applies only when it is stated in the accepted commercial terms and permitted by law.</li>
    <li>
      eLan Technology reserves the right to suspend or withhold services for accounts with overdue
      payments.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Project Scope &amp; Changes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Any changes to the agreed project scope after formal approval are subject to additional charges,
      assessed on a time-and-materials basis.
    </li>
    <li>
      All change requests must be submitted in writing (email or project management system) to be
      considered valid.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Warranties &amp; Limitations of Liability</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Any defect-correction period, service level, maintenance obligation or warranty is limited to
      what is expressly stated in the accepted proposal. It does not cover client changes, unsupported
      environments, third-party changes, misuse or work outside the accepted scope.
    </li>
    <li>
      We are not liable for outages, failures, or disruptions caused by third-party services including
      hosting providers, domain registrars, payment gateways, or third-party APIs.
    </li>
    <li>
      To the extent permitted by applicable law and subject to any different accepted agreement, our
      aggregate liability connected with a specific service is limited to the amount paid for that service.
    </li>
    <li>
      We are not liable for indirect, consequential, or incidental damages, including loss of business
      or revenue.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Confidentiality</h2>
  <p>
    Confidentiality obligations follow the accepted proposal or NDA, including permitted recipients,
    exclusions and duration. For our general operating approach, please see
    our <a href="/nda-confidentiality-policy/">NDA &amp; Confidentiality Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Termination</h2>
  <p>
    Termination rights and notice periods follow the accepted agreement. Unless that agreement says
    otherwise, a termination request must be made in writing, completed work and committed third-party
    costs remain payable, and handover is subject to payment, security and licence restrictions.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy and Client Data</h2>
  <p>
    Our handling of personal data submitted through this website is described in the
    <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>. For client systems, the parties will document the
    relevant roles, permitted processing, access, providers, security responsibilities, incident
    contacts, retention and return or deletion arrangements appropriate to the accepted scope.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    Domains, hosting, payment services, advertising platforms, licensed software, APIs and other
    external services remain subject to their own availability, pricing, policies and licences.
    Unless expressly included, their fees and contractual relationship are the client’s responsibility.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may revise these website terms prospectively. A material change does not retrospectively alter
    an accepted project agreement unless both parties agree in writing or applicable law requires it.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing Law</h2>
  <p>
    These Terms and Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India.
    Any disputes arising under or in connection with these terms shall be subject to the exclusive
    jurisdiction of the courts of Nagpur, Maharashtra, India.
  </p>
  <p>
    This clause does not remove a consumer, privacy or other statutory right that cannot lawfully be
    waived or restricted by these website terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For any questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@elan-tech.net">info@elan-tech.net</a></li>
    <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+919822231642">+91 9822231642</a></li>
    <li>
      Address: <a href="https://share.google/PklD3tFGBBqsPHjli" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">eLan Technology, Basement Floor, PTG IT Park, Plot No. 21, IT Park Rd, Gayatri Nagar, Nagpur, Maharashtra 440022, India</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</LegalLayout>
